{"title": "Self-Same Trial (Condition)", "pageid": 31739, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Self-Same_Trial_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Illusory Self Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Illusory_Self_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Self-Same Trial</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Shar has created this reflection as a test. If a creature attacks a reflection that is not their own, it incurs <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cheater%27s_Folly_(Condition)\" title=\"Cheater's Folly (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cheater's Folly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cheater%27s_Folly_(Condition)\" title=\"Cheater's Folly (Condition)\">Cheater's Folly</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SHA_TORTURETRIAL_DOUBLE_TARGET</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SHA_TORTURETRIAL_DOUBLE_TARGET+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SHA_TORTURETRIAL_DOUBLE_TARGET+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Self-Same_Trial\">Sources of Self-Same Trial</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects any characters that participate in the <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Same_Trial\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Self-Same Trial\">Self-Same Trial</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Once a party member has defeated their own reflection, he is free to attack the other reflections. The curse of Cheater's Folly will not be incurred.</li>\n<li>Can be removed with the <a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\">Remove Curse</a> spell.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714230331\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 970/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9822/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4421/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 980611/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.861      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   39.861      1 -total\n 63.05%   25.133      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.76%   11.465      1 Template:PageSeo\n 19.95%    7.953      1 Template:Cond\n 16.23%    6.471      3 Template:Template_style\n 16.19%    6.454      2 Template:Condition_sources\n  9.73%    3.878      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n  9.37%    3.735      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  9.30%    3.709     11 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31739-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714230331 and revision id 395221. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}